## Vendored FFmpeg/FFprobe binaries (never committed; resolved at runtime
## relative to the app, never via PATH - see SceneForge.Media.Tooling.FfmpegToolLocator)
tools/
**/tools/ffmpeg/

## Generated fixture binaries (never committed - regenerated deterministically
## from tests/fixtures/manifest.json via SceneForge.Accuracy's `generate`
## command; see tests/fixtures/README.md)
tests/fixtures/generated/

## Packaging: vendor binaries (ffmpeg, the VC++ redistributable) are never
## committed - each has its own redistribution license that must be
## reviewed before shipping; see packaging/vendor/README.md and
## LICENSE_NOTICE.md. Built installers/ZIPs are reproducible from source
## and vendor/ via packaging/scripts/, so they are not committed either.
packaging/vendor/ffmpeg/*
!packaging/vendor/ffmpeg/.gitkeep
packaging/vendor/vcredist/*
!packaging/vendor/vcredist/.gitkeep
packaging/output/
